{"id":"wb-7-1064","name":"北岸吴氏宗祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北岸吴氏宗祠","text":"北岸吴氏宗祠位于中国安徽省黄山市歙县北岸镇北岸村，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n北岸吴氏宗祠始建于明末天启二年（1623），以泰伯为吴氏始祖，名为至德堂，清朝乾隆末年重建，道光六年（1826年）扩建。吴氏宗祠共三进，由前至后有门厅、享堂、寝殿，面阔18.37米，进深44.11米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E5%B2%B8%E5%90%B4%E6%B0%8F%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":88057049,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88057049","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/11aa6484059c926eeecc412b.jpg","title":"吳氏宗祠1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%90%B3%E6%B0%8F%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/30/%E5%90%B3%E6%B0%8F%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"原上传者为中文維基百科的Hongyang813","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"​安徽省黃山市歙縣北岸鎮吳氏宗祠","width":320,"height":213}}